## Third-Party Data Licenses

MIT covers the **source code** of this project. The following data files and
fonts are distributed under their respective licenses:

### SBL Greek New Testament (SBLGNT)

Files in `public/data/bibles/grc/*.json` and `docs/clear-bible-alignments/SBLGNT.tsv`
are derived from the SBL Greek New Testament.

> Scripture quotations marked SBLGNT are from the SBL Greek New Testament.
> Copyright © 2010 Society of Biblical Literature and Logos Bible Software.

**License:** Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY 4.0),
see https://sblgnt.com/license/

Token metadata (lemmas, Strong's numbers, glosses) in
`docs/clear-bible-alignments/SBLGNT.tsv` is Copyright © 2023 Clear Bible, Inc.,
licensed under CC-BY 4.0.

**Source:** https://github.com/Clear-Bible/Alignments
(`data/sources/SBLGNT.tsv`, commit `6473aa4`)

### Russian–Greek alignment data

The alignment pairs in `public/data/bibles/syn/*.json` are generated by
`scripts/convert-alignments.js` (this project, MIT) by matching the project's
hand-curated lexicon (`public/data/lexicon/core.json`) against Strong's
numbers from the SBLGNT token metadata attributed above. See
`docs/clear-bible-alignments/README.md` for details.

### Синодальный перевод (Russian Synodal Bible)

The Russian Synodal translation text in `public/data/bibles/syn/*.json` is in
the **public domain**.

### Gentium Plus Font

Font files in `fonts/GentiumPlus-*.woff2` are Copyright © 2003–2022
SIL International.

**License:** SIL Open Font License 1.1 (OFL-1.1)
**Source:** https://software.sil.org/gentium/

### bolls.life API

The Synodal translation data was obtained via the open bolls.life API.
